 221:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) __HAL_I2C_DISABLE:    Disable the I2C peripheral
 222:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) __HAL_I2C_GET_FLAG:   Checks whether the specified I2C flag is set or not
 223:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) __HAL_I2C_CLEAR_FLAG: Clear the specified I2C pending flag
 224:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) __HAL_I2C_ENABLE_IT:  Enable the specified I2C interrupt
 225:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) __HAL_I2C_DISABLE_IT: Disable the specified I2C interrupt
